      "url": "https://www.unicode.org/Public/16.0.0/ucd/NamesList.txt",
      "pages": null,
      "notes": "U+0929 DEVANAGARI LETTER NNNA: \"for transcribing Dravidian alveolar n\"; U+0931 DEVANAGARI LETTER RRA: \"for transcribing Dravidian alveolar r\", \"half form is represented as \\\"Eyelash RA\\\"\"; U+0934 DEVANAGARI LETTER LLLA: \"for transcribing Dravidian l\". Each letter is canonically equivalent to its base letter plus U+093C (0928, 0930, 0933), and is not a composition exclusion."
